{"id":"n5-056","title":"Verb ませんか。 (Verb-masenka)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"An invitation or suggestion; 'won't you', 'why don't you', 'shall we'.","longExplanation":"The ませんか grammar point is used for making invitations or suggestions in a polite manner. The verb is conjugated to its ます form and replaced with ませんか. This can be translated as 'won't you', 'why don't you', or 'shall we' in English.","formation":"Verb (ます-form) + ませんか","examples":[{"jp":"一緒に映画を見ませんか。","romaji":"Issho ni eiga wo mimasenka.","en":"Won't you watch a movie together with me?","words":[{"surface":"一緒","vocabId":"1163400","reading":"いっしょ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"明日のパーティーに参加しませんか。","romaji":"Ashita no paatii ni sanka shimasenka.","en":"Why don't you join tomorrow's party?","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"パーティー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"参加","vocabId":"1302090","reading":"さんか"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"週末にピクニックに行きませんか。","romaji":"Shuumatsu ni pikunikku ni ikimasenka.","en":"Shall we go for a picnic on the weekend?","words":[{"surface":"週末","vocabId":"1333520","reading":"しゅうまつ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ピクニック","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"一緒に勉強しませんか。","romaji":"Issho ni benkyou shimasenka.","en":"How about studying together?","words":[{"surface":"一緒","vocabId":"1163400","reading":"いっしょ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]}]}